a social worker thinks she has rescued a  girl from her abusive parents but then  realizes that the girl is not as  innocent as she seems so today on cinema  recap i'll show you case 39 the film  begins with a woman named emily who  works as a social worker and has closed  a total of 38 cases her boss arrives and  gives her a new case case 39 the case  involves a girl named lilith who  misbehaves in class because she suffers  from domestic violence at home so the  social workers go to the girl's house to  talk to her parents about it however  lilly's parents have a very strange  behavior the mother never smiles and the  father does not even want to exchange a  word with emily then emily tells her  boss about the parents strange behavior  so her boss calls the couple in to talk  to them at the police station however  when they show up they seem like they  are great parents emily finds a way to  talk to lilith in private so she can see  if she's being mistreated at home  melilith responds that her parents hate  her and that she has even heard them say  they want to send her to hell then emily  asked a friend who is a police officer  to help her get the girl out of the  house because she believes that the  parents are planning to hurt her however  the policeman tells her that in order to  help her she has to show evidence that  the girl is in danger the next day emily  meets lilith at her school to give her  her phone number in case she ever feels  unsafe at home that night emily receives  a call from lilith who tells her that  she thinks her parents are planning  something bad but she ends up falling  asleep so emily calls her friend and  they both go to the girl's house to  verify that she's okay however when they  arrive they realize that the parents are  trying to kill lilith by putting her in  an oven so emily and the police enter  the house they fight the parents and  they save the little girl the couple was  put on trial where the judge orders a  psychiatric examination since it is  possible that their mental health is not  well this makes emily angry because she  believes that they should be in jail  meanwhile lilith is transferred to an  orphanage where she could find a new  family but she doesn't like living there  so she tells emily that she wants to  live with her and although emily at  first refuses she ends up asking her  boss for an authorization to take  custody for the girl until the orphanage  finds a family for her emily takes the  girl home and takes good care of her the  next day her work sends her to lilith's  old house and as she's exploring she  sees a lock on her parents bedroom as if  they were afraid that someone would  break in meanwhile we see a child that  is in therapy because he has problems  with his behavior he seems to be a quiet  child who loves his parents a lot this  child is in a group therapy with lilith  and other children with a psychologist  who is also emily's co-worker emily  picks lilith up from therapy and takes  her home then the next day when emily  goes to work her boss tells her that the  child who was in therapy killed his  parents the night before emily goes to  the crime scene and talks to the boy but  he seems to be very sorry for what he's  done and he even cries emily is confused  at this as she doesn't know why the  child would do such a thing so she talks  to her co-worker the psychologist but he  tells her to not let it bother her the  next day emily is chilling at home and  suddenly realizes that lilith has a  photo that belongs to her as she was  looking through her things emily doesn't  get angry at this but she tells lilly  that the lady in the photo is her mother  that she died in a car accident however  when she finishes talking to lilith  emily takes her personal things and puts  them in a locked room so lilith cannot  touch them again the next day emily goes  to eat with her friend the policeman  there through the newspaper she realizes  that lilly's parents were declared crazy  and will probably be transferred to a  psychiatric care then the policeman  tells emily that the night the child  killed his parents he had received a  call from emily's house but emily tells  the policeman that she did not call him  so they both come to the conclusion that  maybe lilith is the one who made the  call emily and the policemen talked to  lilith and asked her if she had any  contact with the boy that night but lily  tells him that she did not call anyone  and emily seems to believe her but the  policeman doesn't the next day emily  asked the boy who called him that night  however when emily asked this the boy  begins to feel frightened and even has  problems breathing so he's transferred  to the hospital where the boy confirms  to emily that someone called him but it  was a man that same day lilith has a  session with a psychologist he asked her  what is her worst fear and lilith answer  is that she will tell him what she is  afraid of only if he answers the  question first so the psychologist then  tells lilith that he is afraid of bees  and lilith tells him that she is afraid  of herself  since she has bad thoughts about people  and even confesses that she has bad  thoughts involving him after talking  about the thoughts she warns him that he  should worry about what is to come as if  she's threatening him so the  psychologist gets scared and confused by  the behavior of the girl he tells emily  what happened then goes home when he  arrives he begins to receive strange  calls with weird sounds suddenly he  starts to feel discomfort in one of his  ears and after examining himself he  finds a bee he throws it into the toilet  but then more and more be start to come  out from his ears and other parts of his  body making him go crazy until he ends  up killing himself then emily attends  the funeral and she begins to feel that  something is wrong with lilith because  she remembers that the psychologist told  her that he felt threatened by her emily  then begins to investigate and finds a  video recording where lilith's mother  says that her and her husband used to  have brothers but when lilith was born  they began to die one by one and she  blames the girl saying that she is the  incarnation of evil the mother also says  that she could not get rid of her until  lilith found someone new and this makes  emily feel very scared emily decides to  go see lilly's parents at the clinic  however the nurse tells her that the  mother has gone crazy because she  scratches her own skin so emily has no  choice but to talk to the father instead  he tells her about lilith and that she  is not his daughter but an old  destructive soul like a demon that she  feeds off the goodness of people he  warns her that she is going to hurt her  using her worst fear against her emily  gets scared at this and when she gets  home she starts to put away all the  important papers and phones and any  objects that lilith could use to hurt  her  leaving only a knife to defend herself  with at that moment lilith arrives from  school and begins to ask why the phones  are gone and emily says that they broke  down then we see that lilith is  suspicious of the situation the next day  emily asked the orphanage if they have  found a family for lilly but the manager  tells her that not yet and that for now  emily has to take responsibility of her  because she was the one who promised to  take care of her emily has no choice but  to continue taking care of lilith  so she goes to pick her up from a  therapy session with a psychologist  and when she arrives she sees that  lilith is whispering things into a  girl's ear emily thinks that she is  putting strange ideas into her head so  angrily she pulls lilith away from the  other girl the psychologist seeing this  scolds emily from mistreating the girl  but lilith says it's okay then on the  way to the elevator emily tells lilith  that she will not be returning to those  sessions because she does not want her  to be around other children lilith gets  angry at this and tells emily are you  sure  and suddenly emily can feel that the  elevator is broken and when it's about  to crash to the ground everything goes  back to normal and the elevator's door  is open emily gets even more scared so  she decides to go see her friend the  police to tell him everything hoping  that he can help her however he doesn't  believe her and he only tells her that  it's all in her head and that none of it  is real so emily has no choice but to  protect herself she puts locks in her  room  but lilith realizes this emily locks  herself in the room and takes a  screwdriver for self-defense  at night as it's raining outside and  there's a thunderstorm lilith knocks on  her door saying that she is afraid but  emily does not want to open the door so  she just ignores her however lilith  begins to knock louder and louder on the  door yelling at her to let her in emily  get scared and when it seemed that the  girl was gone suddenly emily sees a  monster coming out of her closet so she  runs out of the house she runs down the  street and sees a bus driver and asks  for help but he tells her that no one is  chasing her and when emily turns to the  street she doesn't see any monster so  she just walks away without knowing  where to go she decides to get in her  car and try to escape but lilith is in  the backseat and tells her that she must  never leave her alone and that from now  on she has to obey everything she says  so emily begins to cry out of  desperation and fear the next day she  sees lilith's father again but this time  she asked him how to get rid of the girl  the man replies that she must kill her  but this can only be done while she's  sleeping although lilith rarely sleeps  emily then goes to the policeman again  and asks for help and this time he  believes her and even offers to help  kill the girl so emily goes home to look  for lilith while the policeman gets a  gun however when the officer leaves a  police station with a gun he sees that a  bunch of dogs are growling at him when  he gets in his car he discovers that  there is a dog in the car waiting for  him and it bites him in the neck so the  policeman tries to shoot it with the gun  but he fails and ends up shooting  himself emily receives a call letting  her know that the officer died at this  emily gets really angry and demands  lilith to leave her house however lilith  answers with a demon voice that she must  never yell at her again emily gets  scared and runs through her room and  covers the door with everything she can  find the lilith begins to bang on the  door with such force that it knocks it  down so emily runs to hide under her bed  lilith approaches her slowly so emily  asks what she wants the girl replies  that she only wants her love so emily  tells her that she can love her if she  doesn't hurt her that night emily  prepares coffee for lilith and crushes  sleeping pills to give it to her then  when she is asleep she starts to pour  gasoline in the house and burns the girl  alive however when she leaves she  realizes that lilith is outside as well  then both emily and lilith get in the  car driving without a destination lilith  then tells emily that she finally knows  what she is afraid of being like her  mother because apparently she was a  woman who hated herself and also hated  her own daughter then emily looks at  herself in the rearview mirror as she is  transforming into her mother and she can  barely keep a grip on driving  as if she was going to have a car  accident just like her mother however  emily begins to say that none of this is  true until everything finally returns to  normal and now lilith is the one who  gets scared at that moment emily turns a  car towards a lake then she fights a  demon underwater until she manages to  lock him in emily finally comes to the  surface safe and sound and looks into  the water and sees bubbles she can  finally rest  the end if you liked the video please  leave a like and subscribe to continue  receiving the recaps of the best horror  movies my name is tc and i'll see you in  the next video goodbye

